  (text "BUILD NOTES\n- Same-name labels are connected (e.g. VREF, TIA_OUT, I2C_SDA).\n- Keep D1, R3, C2 and U2 pins 1-3 close together, short wires.\n- D1 looks at the cuvette at 90 deg to the LED, behind a\n  long-pass (green/yellow) emission filter. Box must be light-tight.\n- BC547 pinout is C-B-E (flat face toward you). 2N2222 differs."
    (at 186 124 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "e2d91f17-2762-4ecf-b90f-586ef486f4b3"))
